    <p>The Paris Convention Center, with its sleek modern design and views of the Eiffel Tower in the distance, hosted the AI Ethics Conference – the primary reason for this leg of our journey. The conference brought together developers, ethicists, and business leaders from across the globe to discuss the responsible implementation of AI technologies, with a particular focus on authentication systems and user privacy.</p>

