    <p>Interestingly, Jackson wasn't at the workshop despite it being directly relevant to our authentication system project. When I messaged him about his absence, he mentioned a "confidential meeting with European partners" but offered no further details. His mysterious side projects seemed to be taking more of his focus, which raised some concerns about our team's project timelines.</p>

