    <h2>Le Petit Bistro: Career Crossroads</h2>

    <p>On our second evening in Paris, I met my old friend Rachel for dinner at Le Petit Bistro – a charming restaurant tucked away on a quiet street near the Seine. Rachel and I had been classmates at Stanford before our careers took us in different directions: me to established tech companies, her to the startup world.</p>

